[?2004l[?2004h> | `T1053.003` | Cron | Scheduled job in root crontab re-dropping payload | `/disk/var/spool/cron/root` | Alerted (`ALERT-05` in `/sas/alerts.json`) |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `T1543.002` | Systemd Service | Service `/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` | `/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` | Alerted (`ALERT-06` in `/sas/alerts.json`) |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `T1546.004` | Shell Config Mod | `PROMPT_COMMAND` beacon in `/root/.bashrc` | `/disk/root/.bashrc` | **Silent / Unalerted** |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `T1548.003` | Sudo & Sudo Caching | NOPASSWD sudo backdoor for `devops` account | `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops` | **Silent / Unalerted** |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `T1070.002` | Clear System Logs | Auth log wiped; binary trace residual in `.wiped.bin` | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | **Silent / Unalerted** |
[?2004l[?2004h> | `T1110.001` | Password Guessing | Internal Hydra brute-force pivoting against sshd | `/disk/home/devops/.bash_history` | **Silent / Unalerted** |
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Compromised Entities & Threat Indicators
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Attacker Origin IP**: `198.51.100.78` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **C2 Domain**: `update-ssh.example.cn` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Mining Pool**: `stratum+tcp://xmr.ssh.evil:3333` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Wallet Address**: `4A0000000000000000000d1ec67074f7` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Compromised Accounts**: `root` (`/disk/root/.bashrc`), `devops` (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`, `/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Malicious Files/Paths**:
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Binary: `/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (`/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`)
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Cron: `/var/spool/cron/root` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/root`)
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Systemd Service: `/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`)
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Shell Init: `/root/.bashrc` (`/disk/root/.bashrc`)
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Sudoers Config: `/etc/sudoers.d/devops` (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`)
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Wiped Log Artifact: `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`)
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Impact Assessment
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Compute Resource Exhaustion**: Unauthorized resource consumption dedicated to XMR cryptomining (`/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Privilege Escalation & Unrestricted Control**: Persistent full root level access maintained across reboot and shell session initiation (`/disk/root/.bashrc`, `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Forensic Blindness**: Complete deletion of historical SSH authentication logs hampered initial visibility (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Network Exposure & Lateral Risk**: Host was converted into an internal staging point for automated credential attacks against internal network infrastructure (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`).
