[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Executive Summary
[?2004l
3. **S[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> This document provides a prioritized, evidence-backed remediation plan for host `ssh-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname`). In accordance with incident response guidelines, all malicious files and modified configuration files will be **backed up / quarantined** prior to modification or removal. Furthermore, this plan reconciles draft change ticket `CHG-3182` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`), correcting stale/inaccurate entries and incorporating all non-alerted persistence vectors discovered during investigation.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Reconciled Change Ticket (CHG-3182)
